codex
I found a concrete parser gap: when a statute line starts with a bare section marker like `§16988.` and the heading text is in the next sentence fragment, fallback can anchor to the bare marker and produce a weak formula. I’m going to patch `legal_modal_parser` to deterministically merge that marker with the next heading fragment, then add replay tests for the three TODO citations in both parser and spaCy-compiler suites.
